From d3b2880e1dfe7d8f7b686a269a2fbd41ec07fbde Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Wed, 30 Sep 2026 03:01:04 -0600
Subject: [PATCH] Blighted forms for every building, and two stance slots
 (2026-09-30)

Every building now has a blighted form (level 2): a trade, not a penalty.
Training Grounds Blood Drills, Dissolution Hungry Vats, Library
Whispering Stacks, Scriptorum Fevered Copying, Scrying Clouded Water,
Courier Loose Lips, Undercroft Rotten Cellar, Embassy Tainted Gifts,
Armory Rusted Racks, Dormitory Restless Sleep, Gatehouse Open Gate,
Sanctum Profaned Lectern. BlightedForms.cs holds the numbers and the one
line per building the campus card now shows.

Stances: every martial holds two (their authored pair), a third at
Training Grounds T2, plus the signature. T1 opens retraining. Combat
fields at most the slot count.

- OwnedCard.LastUpgradeLunation (Fevered Copying), round-trip asserted.
- Review fixes: Tainted Gifts and Loose Lips Exposure survive the moon's
  decay; Clouded Water drains once on a real start only; the Courtier
  price honours Tainted Gifts; Whispering Stacks skips cards already in
  research; the Fevered lock is keyed on year and moon.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01RF7HNp6pvyXiAz229q52Px
